[{"id":180516312,"discussion_id":"4c867c6134d368cd2ea02bec60765529569aaad2","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 reduce 算子中非连续地址计算的错误，主要涉及 `ReduceSchAuxNonContiguous` 类中的 `ComputeIterAddress` 函数。原有的 `curInSliceNum` 计算方式为 `step / stepSize`，得到的是绝对切片索引；修正后改为 `(step / stepSize) % sliceStepSize`，使其正确反映切片周期内的偏移位置。为此，函数签名新增了 `sliceStepSize` 参数，所有调用点均同步传入 `this->loopAAxisSliceStep_` 或 `this->loopRAxisSliceStep_`。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`ComputeIterAddress` 函数签名扩展**：新增 `uint64_t sliceStepSize` 参数，用于支持切片步长的取模运算，函数从 5 个参数变为 6 个参数。\n- **`curInSliceNum` 计算逻辑修正**：将原来的 `auto curInSliceNum = temp / stepSize;` 改为 `temp /= stepSize; auto curInSliceNum = temp % sliceStepSize;`，使切片编号的计算从绝对索引变为切片周期内的相对位置。\n- **调用点同步更新**：`CalculateIterA`、`CalculateInnerIterR` 以及尾轴循环中的四处 `ComputeIterAddress` 调用均增加了 `this->loopAAxisSliceStep_` 或 `this->loopRAxisSliceStep_` 实参。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-17T16:36:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-17T17:24:53+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180516314,"discussion_id":"5b0832248279c288c1f56b694a45b7f3d5ffe42d","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查结论\n\n### 发现汇总\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 0    |\n| P1     | 1    |\n| P2     | 0    |\n| P3     | 0    |\n\n**变更文件**:\n- `pkg_inc/op_common/atvoss/reduce/reduce_sch_aux_non_contiguous.h` — 发现 1 个 P1 问题\n\n**整体风险判断**: 本次 diff 修复了 `ComputeIterAddress` 中非连续地址计算的逻辑（将 `curInSliceNum = step / stepSize` 改为 `(step / stepSize) % sliceStepSize`），同时在 `CalculateIterA` 和 `CalculateIterR` 中正确更新了递归调用以除以 `loopAAxisSliceStep_` / `loopRAxisSliceStep_`。但 `CalculateInnerIterR` 的第 343 行递归调用遗漏了除以 `loopRAxisSliceStep_`，在 `ubFactorR > sliceShape` 且 `loopInnerRCount > 1` 的特定场景下会导致内层轴地址计算错误。该问题需要修复后才能合入。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-17T16:36:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-17T17:29:10+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180516332,"discussion_id":"5101cf2189e219c54cbd33de0febabcf227a753a","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| pkg_inc | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n Sunee, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-17T16:36:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-20T09:35:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180531418,"discussion_id":"3416c442b39b451e5d37b1353eb329b50437e1af","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n**变更行**: `CalculateInnerIterR` 第 343 行递归调用 `CalculateInnerIterR<LoopInnerRIdx - 1>(basicBlockIdx / this->loopRAxisStep_)`。\n\n**问题**: 本次 diff 修改了 `ComputeIterAddress` 的语义，将 step 拆解为两层：`curInSliceShape = step % stepSize`（shape 内位置）和 `curInSliceNum = (step / stepSize) % sliceStepSize`（slice 组内编号）。这意味着当前轴\"消耗\"的维度是 `stepSize * sliceStepSize`。递归到下一个内层轴时，step 必须除以 **两者**。\n\n在 `CalculateIterA`（第 212 行）和 `CalculateIterR`（第 362-363、370-371 行）中，递归前都正确地依次除以 `axisStep_` 和 `axisSliceStep_`，但 `CalculateInnerIterR` 第 343 行只除 `loopRAxisStep_`，遗漏了 `loopRAxisSliceStep_`。\n\n**触发条件**: \n\n**失败模式**: 内层轴的 step 值未被正确缩减，导致 `iterAddr_` 的 `start`/`sliceStart`/`stride` 计算出错，最终产生错误的 GM 地址，造成数据读取/写入错位，输出数据错误。\n\n```suggestion\n                CalculateInnerIterR<LoopInnerRIdx - 1>(basicBlockIdx / this->loopRAxisStep_ / this->loopRAxisSliceStep_);\n```\n","created_at":"2026-07-17T17:29:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T09:29:54+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","login":"Sunee","object_id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","name":"Sunee","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Sunee"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":343,"end_new_line":343,"start_old_line":340,"end_old_line":340,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":180579499,"body":"changed this line on [e7d43254](https://gitcode.com/cann/opbase/commits/detail/e7d432543c0c0cd61327d6d57d658b2816936adc?ref=fix/contiguous&prId=651) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/opbase/merge_requests/651/diffs?diffId=6850204&start_sha=974ea3b5d61b79aa39a36bc2530e05c5632bda74&filePath=pkg_inc/op_common/atvoss/reduce/reduce_sch_aux_non_contiguous.h#c83f8be16ce46214e8da4783b50578d3fa1145f4_340_343)","created_at":"2026-07-18T09:29:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T09:29:57+08:00","user":{"id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","login":"Sunee","object_id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","name":"Sunee","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Sunee"}}]},{"id":180579558,"discussion_id":"5e18048c5bc843697dfc2722fd1ab8c282bc4d66","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-18T09:30:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T09:30:47+08:00","user":{"id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","login":"Sunee","object_id":"68905f83ee657552d3976e78","name":"Sunee","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Sunee"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180579704,"discussion_id":"5e063475ee2f1773e0a9de644f6ffbc3a1f778ec","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=867b05c0cff744d68efb109e241a4392&pipelineRunId=6c0c963a7b4c4fbaac9b8f13e2fd6a7f&projectName=CANN'>6c0c963a7b4c4fbaac9b8f13e2fd6a7f</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_310fd3f1f36e4ee7ba1ad934c6704361/8df49184fda1446ac40414a80187b514?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personal